":1.29,"kd":4.5,"tax":21,"growth_10y":[5.4,4.9,4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":10.62,"ev":5213.4,"fmp_official_ev":5213.4,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":4103.5,"ev_to_ebitda":23.7,"debt_to_ebitda":0.04,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-3.2,"f_score":9,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 12.8%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $299M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 15.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 6.37"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":26.97,"default_fair_val":26.97,"premium_pct":23.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":42.4,"pe_forward":37.3,"pb_trailing":6.4,"pb_forward":5.8,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":4.9,"fcf_to_ev":5.74,"fcf_to_mcap":5.05,"liab_to_assets":15,"cash_to_assets":65.3,"current_ratio":6.37,"roe":15,"roa":12.8,"moat":{"ticker":"DOCS","period":"2027Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Doximity 在醫療資訊服務領域建立了強大的品牌聲譽，使其能夠收取高於競爭對手的費用。其平台匯聚了大量醫生用戶，形成了一個難以被模仿的專業社群，這使得新進入者難以挑戰其定價能力。這種品牌忠誠度和專業認可度，類似於巴菲特所欣賞的具有定價權的特許經營模式，儘管它不是傳統意義上的收費橋。其高 ROE 和 ROA 表明了其將品牌優勢轉化為盈利的能力。","comment_en":"Doximity has established a strong brand reputation in the healthcare information services sector, enabling it to command premium pricing over competitors. Its platform aggregates a large user base of physicians, creating a professional community that is difficult to replicate, making it challenging for new entrants to contest its pricing power. This brand loyalty and professional recognition resemble the pricing power of a franchise business that Buffett admires, even if it's not a traditional toll bridge. Its high ROE and ROA demonstrate its ability to convert brand strength into profitability."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的業務模式主要依賴於其平台技術和數據的整合能力，而非受專利保護的獨特藥物或醫療設備。雖然其平台可能擁有某些技術專利，但這些專利在醫療資訊服務領域的壁壘相對較低，且容易被模仿或被其他技術繞過。監管環境對醫療數據的使用有嚴格要求，這可能構成一定的進入門檻，但並非 Doximity 獨有的專利或特許壁壘。","comment_en":"Doximity's business model relies primarily on its platform technology and data integration capabilities, rather than on patented unique drugs or medical devices. While its platform may hold certain technological patents, these patents offer relatively low barriers in the healthcare information services sector and can be easily imitated or circumvented by other technologies. The regulatory environment imposes strict requirements on the use of medical data, which may constitute a certain entry barrier, but this is not a patent or regulatory moat unique to Doximity."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的平台為醫生提供了整合的臨床工具、專業新聞和社交網絡，這些功能高度依賴於用戶的習慣和工作流程。一旦醫生習慣了 Doximity 的生態系統，切換到另一個平台將意味著重新學習、適應新的界面和工具，並可能失去已建立的聯繫和信息流。這種對現有工作流程的深度整合，構成了顯著的轉換成本，增加了用戶黏性。","comment_en":"Doximity's platform offers physicians integrated clinical tools, professional news, and a social network. These features are highly dependent on user habits and workflows. Once physicians become accustomed to Doximity's ecosystem, switching to another platform would entail relearning, adapting to new interfaces and tools, and potentially losing established connections and information flow. This deep integration into existing workflows constitutes significant switching costs, increasing user stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的網絡效應非常顯著。隨著越來越多的醫生加入其平台，其價值對每個用戶而言都呈指數級增長。更多的醫生意味著更豐富的臨床數據、更廣泛的專業交流和更多的合作機會，這反過來又吸引了更多的醫生。同時，製藥公司和醫療設備商也因其龐大的醫生用戶群體而更傾向於在其平台投放廣告和進行推廣，進一步強化了網絡效應，形成了一個難以打破的閉環。","comment_en":"Doximity exhibits very strong network effects. As more physicians join its platform, its value grows exponentially for each user. More doctors mean richer clinical data, broader professional exchange, and more collaboration opportunities, which in turn attract more physicians. Concurrently, pharmaceutical companies and medical device manufacturers are more inclined to advertise and promote on its platform due to its large physician user base, further reinforcing the network effects and creating a difficult-to-break closed loop."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Doximity 作為領先的醫療資訊平台，通過其龐大的用戶基礎和數據量，在獲取和處理醫療數據方面可能具有一定的規模經濟效益。這使得其在開發和維護平台功能時，單位成本低於小型競爭對手。然而，與傳統製造業或零售業的規模成本優勢相比，其成本優勢更多體現在技術和運營效率上，而非原材料採購或生產製造。","comment_en":"As a leading healthcare information platform, Doximity may benefit from certain economies of scale in acquiring and processing medical data due to its vast user base and data volume. This allows for lower unit costs in developing and maintaining platform features compared to smaller competitors. However, compared to the scale cost advantages in traditional manufacturing or retail industries, its cost advantage is more reflected in technological and operational efficiency rather than raw material procurement or production."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的業務主要集中在美國醫療市場，其核心競爭力在於其平台技術、用戶網絡和數據分析能力，而非依賴於特定的地理位置或獨特的實物資產。雖然其在美國市場的領先地位構成了一定的先發優勢，但這並非傳統意義上的地理壟斷或獨特資產壁壘。其業務模式具有一定的可擴展性，理論上可以複製到其他國家或地區，儘管面臨監管和市場適應的挑戰。","comment_en":"Doximity's business is primarily focused on the US healthcare market. Its core competitiveness lies in its platform technology, user network, and data analytics capabilities, rather than relying on specific geographical locations or unique physical assets. While its leading position in the US market constitutes a certain first-mover advantage, this is not a geographical monopoly or a unique asset barrier in the traditional sense. Its business model has a degree of scalability and could theoretically be replicated in other countries or regions, despite facing regulatory and market adaptation challenges."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Doximity 展示了卓越的運營效率，體現在其高達 15.0% 的 ROE 和 12.8% 的 ROA，以及極高的 F-Score (9/9)。這表明公司能夠有效地利用其資產和股東權益產生利潤。其強勁的自由現金流 (FCF TTM: $299.0M) 和極低的負債 (僅 $9.1M)，顯示其營運模式高度健康且能產生充裕現金，無需依賴外部融資，這與巴菲特所尋求的高效運營企業一致。","comment_en":"Doximity demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its high ROE of 15.0% and ROA of 12.8%, along with an exceptionally high F-Score (9/9). This indicates the company's ability to effectively utilize its assets and shareholder equity to generate profits. Its strong Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $299.0M) and very low debt ($9.1M) show that its operating model is highly healthy and generates ample cash, without reliance on external financing, aligning with Buffett's preference for efficiently run businesses."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的財務狀況顯示其資本配置能力強勁。公司擁有充裕的現金儲備 ($713.2M) 和極低的負債，這為其提供了靈活的資本配置選項，包括潛在的戰略收購、研發投入或股東回報。其持續產生高額自由現金流的能力，也證明了管理層在將資本投入到高回報項目上的有效性。儘管具體資本配置決策需進一步觀察，但其穩健的財務結構為優良的資本配置奠定了基礎。","comment_en":"Doximity's financial standing indicates strong capital allocation capabilities. The company possesses ample cash reserves ($713.2M) and very low debt, providing it with flexible capital allocation options, including potential strategic acquisitions, R&D investments, or shareholder returns. Its ability to consistently generate substantial free cash flow also demonstrates management's effectiveness in deploying capital into high-return projects. While specific capital allocation decisions require further observation, its robust financial structure lays the foundation for excellent capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的客戶（醫生）保留率很高，這得益於其平台的高度整合性和網絡效應。一旦醫生將 Doximity 融入其日常臨床實踐和專業交流中，轉換成本會變得很高。平台提供的多樣化服務，從電子處方到專業新聞和遠程醫療工具，都增加了用戶黏性。這種對用戶日常工作流程的深度滲透，使得客戶難以離開，形成了穩固的客戶基礎。","comment_en":"Doximity enjoys high customer (physician) retention rates, attributable to the platform's high degree of integration and network effects. Once physicians incorporate Doximity into their daily clinical practice and professional communication, the switching costs become significant. The diverse services offered by the platform, from e-prescribing to professional news and telehealth tools, enhance user stickiness. This deep penetration into users' daily workflows makes it difficult for customers to leave, forming a stable customer base."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Doximity 的業務模式具有相當的持久性，主要得益於其強大的網絡效應和用戶轉換成本。醫療行業的專業性和監管要求，使得新進入者難以快速複製其平台和用戶基礎。儘管技術會不斷發展，但 Doximity 作為醫生社群的核心樞紐地位，使其能夠適應變化並保持其市場領先地位。其持續的盈利能力和穩健的財務狀況也為其長期發展提供了保障。","comment_en":"Doximity's business model possesses considerable durability, primarily due to its strong network effects and user switching costs. The specialized nature and regulatory requirements of the healthcare industry make it difficult for new entrants to quickly replicate its platform and user base. Although technology will continue to evolve, Doximity's position as the core hub for the physician community allows it to adapt to changes and maintain its market leadership. Its sustained profitability and robust financial condition also provide security for its long-term development."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Doximity 在醫療資訊服務領域展現了強大的經濟護城河，主要由顯著的網絡效應（M4）和較高的客戶轉換成本（M3）所驅動，這使其成為一個類似於「收費橋」的平台，醫生用戶一旦進入便難以離開。其強大的品牌聲譽（M1）也賦予了其一定的定價權。儘管缺乏專利壁壘（M2）和獨特地理資產（M6），但其卓越的運營效率（M7）和穩健的資本配置能力（M8）進一步鞏固了其競爭優勢。整體而言，Doximity 具備類似於特許經營的特徵，在醫療生態系統中扮演著關鍵的連接者角色，展現了持久的競爭力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Doximity demonstrates a strong economic moat in the healthcare information services sector, primarily driven by significant network effects (M4) and high customer switching costs (M3), positioning it as a platform akin to a 'toll bridge' from which physicians find it difficult to exit. Its strong brand reputation (M1) also grants it considerable pricing power. Despite lacking patent barriers (M2) and unique geographical assets (M6), its excellent operational efficiency (M7) and robust capital allocation capabilities (M8) further solidify its competitive advantage. Overall, Doximity exhibits characteristics of a franchise, playing a crucial connecting role within the healthcare ecosystem and showcasing durable competitive strength.","evidenceHash":"9d3d93a354c4ce5180557b64751424e0ebb005e515568ed378b6905f4f15a362","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"9d3d93a354c4ce5180557b64751424e0ebb005e515568ed378b6905f4f15a362","currentEvidenceHash":"9d3d93a354c4ce5180557b64751424e0ebb005e515568ed378b6905f4f15a362"},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:54:57.752Z","evidenceHash":"8ec9b7a9df5fb19bf1debd8896a4c6c7d69a270e0dfbe0d4b9c7dd5f6e45a91d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:54:57.752Z","evidenceHash":"8ec9b7a9df5fb19bf1debd8896a4c6c7d69a270e0dfbe0d4b9c7dd5f6e45a91d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/DOCS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/DOCS.png","website":"https://www.doximity.com","ceo":"Jeffrey A. Tangney","full_time_employees":"880","description":"Doximity, Inc. provides a digital platform, hosted in the cloud, specifically designed for healthcare practitioners throughout the United States. This platform delivers a suite of specialized tools, empowering its members to connect with peers, streamline patient treatment, conduct remote consultations, access current medical information and research, and advance their professional careers. Its primary clientele consists of pharmaceutical companies and healthcare organizations. Established in 2010, the entity initially operated as 3MD Communications, Inc. before rebranding to Doximity, Inc. in June of that year. The company's corporate headquarters are situated in San Francisco, California.","description_en":"Doximity, Inc. provides a digital platform, hosted in the cloud, specifically designed for healthcare practitioners throughout the United States. This platform delivers a suite of specialized tools, empowering its members to connect with peers, streamline patient treatment, conduct remote consultations, access current medical information and research, and advance their professional careers. Its primary clientele consists of pharmaceutical companies and healthcare organizations. Established in 2010, the entity initially operated as 3MD Communications, Inc. before rebranding to Doximity, Inc. in June of that year. The company's corporate headquarters are situated in San Francisco, California.","description_zh":"Doximity, Inc.（美股代碼：DOCS）為 Healthcare 領域之重要企業，專注於 Medical - Healthcare Information Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"500, 3rd Street","city":"San Francisco","state":"CA","zip":"94107","country":"US","phone":"650 549 4330","full_address":"500, 3rd Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, US","range_52w":"17.15-51.85","year_high":51.85,"year_low":17.15,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":17.15,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-04","name":"Wampler Kira Scherer","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2000,"price":1.54,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-11-04","name":"Wampler Kira Scherer","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"C-Conversion","shares":2000,"price":0,"tota